{
  "info": {
    "name": "ZATCA E-Invoicing API (Fatoora)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "ZATCA Phase 2 (Fatoora) API collection.\n\nকীভাবে ব্যবহার করবেন:\n1. `baseUrl` variable-এ environment বেছে নিন। Sandbox: `.../e-invoicing/developer-portal`, simulation: `.../e-invoicing/simulation`, production: `.../e-invoicing/core`।\n2. Simulation বা production-এ একটা Postman environment বানিয়ে select করুন। তখন token আর secret সেই environment-এ সেভ হয়, collection-এ না, তাই collection export বা share করলে credentials যায় না।\n3. `otp` আর `csr` বসান। Sandbox-এ OTP 123345। আগে থেকে দেওয়া নমুনা CSR শুধু 1.1 চেষ্টা করার জন্য, এর private key নেই, তাই এটা দিয়ে invoice sign করা যায় না।\n4. ক্রমানুসারে request চালান। CSID token, secret আর request ID নিজে থেকে variable-এ সেভ হয়।\n\nঅ্যাপ থেকে মান নিতে:\n- Device-এর CSR ও credentials: `php artisan zatca:payload --device=1` → csr, complianceToken, productionToken ইত্যাদি।\n- একটা invoice-এর body: `php artisan zatca:payload INV-000001` → invoiceHash, uuid, invoice। একই নম্বর একাধিক device-এ থাকলে `--device=` দিন। JSON চাইলে `--json`।"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Onboarding",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Compliance CSID",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "en"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Version",
                "value": "V2"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "OTP",
                "value": "{{otp}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/compliance",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "compliance"
              ]
            },
            "description": "CSR আর OTP দিয়ে Compliance CSID নেয়। Response-এর binarySecurityToken, secret আর requestID নিজে থেকে সেভ হয়।\n\n`csr` = PEM CSR-এর base64।",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"csr\": \"{{csr}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = (() => { try { return pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { return {}; } })();",
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (!json.binarySecurityToken) console.log('Response:', pm.response.code, pm.response.text());",
                  "const save = (key, value) => value && (pm.environment.name ? pm.environment : pm.collectionVariables).set(key, value);",
                  "save('complianceToken', json.binarySecurityToken);",
                  "save('complianceSecret', json.secret);",
                  "save('complianceRequestId', json.requestID);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Compliance Invoice Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "en"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Version",
                "value": "V2"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/compliance/invoices",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "compliance",
                "invoices"
              ]
            },
            "description": "সাইন করা নমুনা ইনভয়েস যাচাই করে। Production CSID নেওয়ার আগে প্রতিটা ধরন (standard/simplified × invoice/credit/debit) একবার করে পাঠাতে হয়।",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"invoiceHash\": \"{{invoiceHash}}\",\n  \"uuid\": \"{{uuid}}\",\n  \"invoice\": \"{{invoice}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{complianceToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{complianceSecret}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = (() => { try { return pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { return {}; } })();",
                  "pm.test('Accepted by ZATCA (200/202)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 202]));",
                  "const v = json.validationResults || {};",
                  "console.log('Status:', json.reportingStatus || json.clearanceStatus || v.status || pm.response.code);",
                  "(v.errorMessages || []).forEach(e => console.log('ERROR', e.code, e.message));",
                  "(v.warningMessages || []).forEach(w => console.log('WARNING', w.code, w.message));",
                  "if (pm.response.code >= 400 && !json.validationResults) console.log('Response:', pm.response.text());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 Production CSID",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "en"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Version",
                "value": "V2"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/production/csids",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "production",
                "csids"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Compliance CSID দিয়ে Production CSID নেয়। Token আর secret নিজে থেকে সেভ হয়।",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"compliance_request_id\": \"{{complianceRequestId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{complianceToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{complianceSecret}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = (() => { try { return pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { return {}; } })();",
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (!json.binarySecurityToken) console.log('Response:', pm.response.code, pm.response.text());",
                  "const save = (key, value) => value && (pm.environment.name ? pm.environment : pm.collectionVariables).set(key, value);",
                  "save('productionToken', json.binarySecurityToken);",
                  "save('productionSecret', json.secret);",
                  "save('productionRequestId', json.requestID);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.4 Renew Production CSID",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "en"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Version",
                "value": "V2"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "OTP",
                "value": "{{otp}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/production/csids",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "production",
                "csids"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Production CSID-এর মেয়াদ শেষ হওয়ার আগে নবায়ন করে। নতুন CSR আর Fatoora পোর্টাল থেকে নতুন OTP লাগে।",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"csr\": \"{{csr}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{productionToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{productionSecret}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = (() => { try { return pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { return {}; } })();",
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (!json.binarySecurityToken) console.log('Response:', pm.response.code, pm.response.text());",
                  "const save = (key, value) => value && (pm.environment.name ? pm.environment : pm.collectionVariables).set(key, value);",
                  "save('productionToken', json.binarySecurityToken);",
                  "save('productionSecret', json.secret);",
                  "save('productionRequestId', json.requestID);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Invoices",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 Reporting (Simplified / B2C)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "en"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Version",
                "value": "V2"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Clearance-Status",
                "value": "0"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/invoices/reporting/single",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "invoices",
                "reporting",
                "single"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Simplified ইনভয়েস বা নোট রিপোর্ট করে, দেওয়ার ২৪ ঘণ্টার মধ্যে। Response: reportingStatus = REPORTED / NOT_REPORTED।",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"invoiceHash\": \"{{invoiceHash}}\",\n  \"uuid\": \"{{uuid}}\",\n  \"invoice\": \"{{invoice}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{productionToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{productionSecret}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = (() => { try { return pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { return {}; } })();",
                  "pm.test('Accepted by ZATCA (200/202)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 202]));",
                  "const v = json.validationResults || {};",
                  "console.log('Status:', json.reportingStatus || json.clearanceStatus || v.status || pm.response.code);",
                  "(v.errorMessages || []).forEach(e => console.log('ERROR', e.code, e.message));",
                  "(v.warningMessages || []).forEach(w => console.log('WARNING', w.code, w.message));",
                  "if (pm.response.code >= 400 && !json.validationResults) console.log('Response:', pm.response.text());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 Clearance (Standard / B2B)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "en"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Version",
                "value": "V2"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Clearance-Status",
                "value": "1"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/invoices/clearance/single",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "invoices",
                "clearance",
                "single"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Standard ইনভয়েস বা নোট ক্লিয়ার করে। Response-এর clearedInvoice (base64) হলো ZATCA-র স্ট্যাম্প দেওয়া XML, এটাই ক্রেতাকে দিতে হয়।",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"invoiceHash\": \"{{invoiceHash}}\",\n  \"uuid\": \"{{uuid}}\",\n  \"invoice\": \"{{invoice}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{productionToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{productionSecret}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = (() => { try { return pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { return {}; } })();",
                  "pm.test('Accepted by ZATCA (200/202)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 202]));",
                  "const v = json.validationResults || {};",
                  "console.log('Status:', json.reportingStatus || json.clearanceStatus || v.status || pm.response.code);",
                  "(v.errorMessages || []).forEach(e => console.log('ERROR', e.code, e.message));",
                  "(v.warningMessages || []).forEach(w => console.log('WARNING', w.code, w.message));",
                  "if (pm.response.code >= 400 && !json.validationResults) console.log('Response:', pm.response.text());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
